This directory is generated by `npm run generate` (Orval, config in
orval.config.ts at the repo root) from openapi/openapi.yaml. Do not hand-edit
anything under here -- Aşama C's CI step re-runs generate and fails the
build on any diff, so hand edits get silently discarded on the next
regeneration anyway.

Not generated in this environment: the sandbox this was built in has no
network access, so `orval`, `@redocly/cli`, and `zod` could not actually be
installed or run here. Run `npm install && npm run generate` locally --
that will populate:
  - src/generated/models/       (TS types, one file per schema)
  - src/generated/endpoints/    (fetch client functions, tags-split by
                                  the same 9 domains as supabase/functions/)
  - src/generated/zod/          (zod validators, tags-split, separate
                                  output from the fetch client)
This placeholder file can be deleted once real generated output exists.
